        "claims": "Ebers-Moll transistor at a constant gain of 80 (above every minimum the datasheet gives; it gives no maximum), collector and emitter resistances for its saturation; fixtures for hFE at the datasheet's currents (read through a collector resistor), VCE(sat) and VBE(sat).",
